      "readme": {
        "name": "README.md",
        "bytes": 475,
        "truncated": false,
        "text": "# tidewatch\n\n<!-- badges: start --><!-- badges: end -->\nOffline tide predictions for any port with published harmonic constants.\n\n```sh\ncargo install tidewatch\ntidewatch predict --port brest --days 3\n```\n\n## How it works\n\nEach constituent adds a cosine​ term; `src/harmonics.rs` sums them for every minute.\nPredictions are within 30 cm of the official tables for the ports in `src/ports.rs`.\n\n```sh\ncargo test\n```\n\nMaintained by octo-sailor. It does not model storm surge.\n"
      },
